OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plans #600k upgrade for
OL,4,Awaste depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses are set to spend up to
OL,7,F#600,000 on improvements to a key
OL,8,Foperational depot.
OL,10,FKnutton Lane Depot, in
OL,11,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, is used as a base
OL,12,Ffor the borough council's waste,
OL,13,Frecycling and Streetscene services,
OL,14,Fwith about 150 staff working at the
OL,15,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
