OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plans #600k upgrade for
OL,4,Awaste depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recent years though the facility,
OL,7,Fwhich dates back to the 1960s, has seen
OL,8,Fa "prolonged period of
OL,9,Funderinvestment", but the authority is
OL,10,Fnow planning a "significant programme
OL,11,Fof refurbishment", a report has
OL,12,Fconfirmed.
OL,14,FIf approved by council cabinet members,
OL,15,Fplanned works include better
OL,16,Fsegregation of pedestrians and vehicles
OL,17,Fthrough resurfacing and line marking,
OL,18,Fand upgrades to lighting and CCTV
OL,19,Fsystems.
